> 🪙 The price is set for all the extensions of this wallet: pen loop, pen extensions, and cards extensions. Ask me for a custom version and lower price.

The Alchemist is an exquisite piece of accessory made of high quality Italian premium full grain leather. It comes with two different extensions that provide you with a variety of options for carrying your items. The first extension is a card holder that can carry several cards, and the second one is a pen holder that can fit any standard pen or pencil. With these extensions, you can easily carry all your cards and pens without worrying about losing them.

Moreover, the Alchemist is not just a card and pen holder. It is also a wallet that has ample space for your essentials. You can carry one or two passports, and even a field note book. The Alchemist is perfect for travelers who need to carry their essentials with them at all times. It is compact and stylish, and its premium full grain leather gives it an elegant, authentic and sophisticated look.

Overall, the Alchemist is the perfect accessory for those who value quality and style. Its versatility and functionality make it an indispensable item for your travels, and even for everyday use.

The original design pattern is from Deyan [@dsleathergoods](https://instagram.com/dsleathergoods) on Instagram. For the crafters, you can find the [pattern on Etsy](https://www.etsy.com/listing/1414402257/field-notes-cover-pdf-pattern-notebook).

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

